## Summary
Genova's mayor, Bucci, expresses frustration over alleged misinterpretations of his intercepted comments about 'maiali' (pigs) in the port area, clarifying they refer to chaotic situations in each port zone. He denies using Morandi bridge funds as a favor to Spinelli, calling it a falsehood.

## Key Points
- Mayor Bucci clarifies 'maiali' comments as referring to chaotic port situations
- Denies Morandi bridge funds were used for a favor to Spinelli
- Offers to speak with prosecutors (pm) for clarity


